--- !u!114 &257562990
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 257562988}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<color=#33FFFF><b>GOAL</b></color>

    Survive until the timer hits zero.
    Zombies rise out of your real floor and come for you.


    <color=#33FFFF><b>SETUP</b></color>

    1.
    Scan the floor, then tap to place the beacon.

    2. Walk around and tap the
    floor or a wall to place up to 3 mirrors.

    3. Press START.


    <color=#33FFFF><b>SHOOTING</b></color>

    Hold
    FIRE. Each shot heats the gun; at 100% it overheats for a moment.

    Lasers
    bounce off walls and mirrors and change colour with every bounce. Bank shots
    score more: 1 bounce x1.5, 2 bounces x2, 3 bounces x3.


    <color=#33FFFF><b>ENEMIES</b></color>

    <color=#9BE36B><b>Walker</b></color>
    - walks up and claws you. 3 hits.

    <color=#C6FF3A><b>Spitter</b></color>
    - stops 3 m away and spits acid. 5 hits.

    <color=#B98CFF><b>Ghost</b></color>
    - floats in. Only lasers that bounced off a MIRROR can hurt it. 2 hits.


    <color=#33FFFF><b>CARDS</b></color>

    Walk
    onto a glowing card to collect it: Multi-Shot, Mirror, Prism (splits lasers),
    Freeze, Med Kit.


    <color=#33FFFF><b>TIP</b></color>

    You are the player
    - step back from Walkers and line up mirror shots for big combos.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
